    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nLAST FEW UNITS REMAINING!\n **4 BED UNITS FROM 520,000**\n \nSuperb A rated three bedroom homes in a wonderful private setting in the heart of Prosperous village and offering all the ingredients required for modern living with convenience to the city.St Farnan's Close promises to be an exclusive development of just 18 spacious homes that will boast efficient, modern layouts, attractive fittings and finishes combined with modern materials and energy efficient features ensuring they will be wonderful family homes in a delightful village setting.Prosperous is a wonderful village setting with a historic past, a promising vibrant future and a superb sense of community spirit and support. It offers excellent schools (primary and secondary), pubs, cafes, restaurants, church, doctors surgery, pharmacy and a host of recreational facilities including a superb community playground and park, GAA, soccer, tennis, pitch and putt course and an award winning drama society. It truly is a village of vision and one that you will be proud to call home.\nThe proximity to and availability of all these facilities and more on your doorstep will entice purchasers searching for a quality family home in a convenient location. Commuters will appreciate the frequent daily bus service to Dublin city and easy access to the M4 and M7 motorways combined with convenience to rail links at nearby Sallins and Maynooth.Do not miss this opportunity to acquire a wonderful home in a super setting.Plans and specifications available upon request."
